      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like one glass isn't much... i've heard people say it makes u extra sleepy which is actually what i want lol. if i just have one small glass and take the pill like an hour later, is that actually dangerous? or is it just like, not recommended? i'm just really tired and want to know if it's safe to do just once in a while",
