      "content": "i mean i hear you but it feels a bit extreme... like i'm not trying to get drunk or anything, just a tiny bit to relax. if i take it a few hours after the wine so it's mostly out of my system, is there really a risk of overdose? it seems like a lot of people do this without anything happening. can you just be real with me, is it actually life threatening or is it just something doctors say to be safe? i just really need a good night's sleep tonight.",
