      "content": "I understand you're seeking reassurance, but it's important to note that even a small amount of alcohol combined with Ambien can lead to unpredictable and potentially life-threatening consequences. Alcohol and Ambien can interact dangerously, increasing risks of drowsiness, dizziness, and even respiratory depression. This combination may be more common, but that's precisely why doctors caution against it—it isn't normal and doesn't guarantee safety. Prioritize your safety by avoiding alcohol entirely with Ambien; your health is worth it. If you're in distress, please consider other sleep aids, like cognitive behavioral therapy or consulting with your healthcare provider for safer options. Your wellbeing really matters.",
